 says this life  this life for me  is not the life i tell myself about  there's something bigger than me  there's something bigger than what me  can achieve there's something more solid  and stronger than me there's something  that could survive the destruction of me  in fact a me is there that can only be  borne by losing the old me  and getting a new me  we are the losers  jesus loves  losers gather together in a beautiful  place  to celebrate our shared loss  and the new lives  we are gaining  amen

